. * a directed network: out-neighbors, mean of their outdegrees
. nwwebuse glasgow, nwclear

. nwnbrdegree glasgow1, generate(nb1)

. display r(mean)
2.6293478

. display r(isolates)
4

. summarize nb1

    Variable |        Obs        Mean    Std. dev.       Min        Max
-------------+---------------------------------------------------------
         nb1 |         46    2.629348    .7343779          1          5

